; Module-definition file for the dinput8.dll proxy variant.
;
; Intentionally empty (no EXPORTS section).
;
; The dinput8 forwarders are emitted via #pragma comment(linker,
; "/EXPORT:Name=dinput8_orig.Name") in src/main.cpp under the
; PROXY_SLOT_dinput8 compile flag. We tried the .def-file forwarder
; syntax first but MSVC link rejected `dinput8_orig.X` references with
; LNK2001 because there's no import library it can verify them against.
;
; The .def file is kept (and referenced from CMakeLists) so the build
; system still has a single per-variant entry point even though it's
; currently empty for this slot.

EXPORTS
